			<name>Protective Ward (Su)</name>
			<description>As a standard action, you can create a 10-foot-radius field of protective magic centered on you that lasts 2 rounds. All allies in this area (including you) receive a +1 deflection bonus to their AC. You can use this ability 5 times a day.</description>
